4"}],"events":[{"date":"2026-11-30","type":"entitlement","what":"股东大会登记日","what_en":"AGM record of depositors","ann":"11693291","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693291","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-30","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (9 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Sep (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"},{"date":"2026-12-07","type":"agm","what":"第22届常年股东大会","what_en":"22nd AGM","ann":"11693291","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693291","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"Ni Hsin has recently partnered with Turkey's Spormoto and China's Horwin to advance its electric motorcycle business, with plans to assemble Horwin electric scooters in Malaysia. The company proposed a bonus issue of 1 Warrant C for every 2 existing shares, while its share price fell sharply on 10 November and Bursa issued a trading reminder. Latest quarterly revenue rose 25.7% QoQ but fell 12.9% YoY, remaining in net loss.","notable_en":["Partnered with Turkey's Spormoto targeting distribution of 10,000 electric motorcycles.","Partnered with China's Horwin to assemble electric scooters in Malaysia, with first batch expected in 2027.","Proposed bonus issue of 1 Warrant C for every 2 existing shares, up to 312,651,147 warrants."],"risks_en":["Bursa issued a trading reminder on 10 November after the share price fell 41% in a single day.","Executive Director Ng Shwu Ching indirectly disposed a total of 2,217,300 shares on 28 September.","The company remained in net loss of MYR 1,714,000 in the latest quarter."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue was MYR 8,355,000, up 25.7% QoQ but down 12.9% YoY; net loss was MYR 1,714,000 with a net margin of -20.5%, narrowing from -54.0% in the previous quarter."}